WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:02.920
The Digital World,

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.090
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.090 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.500
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.190 --> 00:00:18.280
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:22.050
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:25.720
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:57.960
So, we know this path takes 
us closer to Bagramon...

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:00.220
But how do we get onto it?

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:02.370
Change Zone!

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:06.660
Guess that's not it.

00:02:06.660 --> 00:02:09.220
If I recall, the Death General said...

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:11.280
"Gate Open."

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:15.120
Gate Open!

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:31.280
What's this gas-like stuff around us?

00:02:32.120 --> 00:02:34.630
It appears to be negative energy.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.030
Negative energy?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:41.260
The dragons in Dragon Land 
were making Digimon suffer

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:43.700
to extract negative energy from them.

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:47.440
It must be connected with the 
Bagra Army's objective somehow.

00:02:49.190 --> 00:02:50.980
Oh, no! The path splits up!

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:52.700
What do we do, Taiki?

00:02:52.700 --> 00:02:54.480
Taking separate paths is a bad idea.

00:02:54.480 --> 00:02:56.720
Everyone take the left path!

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.290
Got it.

00:03:00.020 --> 00:03:00.890
Kiriha?

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:03.910
I'm going this way.

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.560
That little punk, 
always doing his own thing!

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:11.230
He must have something in mind.

00:03:11.230 --> 00:03:13.710
That's how Kiriha is.

00:03:14.210 --> 00:03:22.730
<b>Spine-tingling!</b>

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:22.730
<b>The Moon Light General's Vampire Land</b>

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:18.440
Spine-tingling!

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:21.250
The Moon Light General's Vampire Land!

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.990
Here we are. This is the next Kingdom.

00:03:36.950 --> 00:03:38.910
Where's the Bagra Army?

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:40.020
We'll show 'em...

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.430
...who's boss!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.220
Hey, watch out!

00:03:43.870 --> 00:03:45.920
The path is glowing...

00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:52.880
I see.

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.600
It appears this Kingdom's Death General

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:57.940
is sending a tremendous amount of

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.920
negative energy to the Bagra Castle.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:01.950
It's visible from this Kingdom, too...

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.340
What is that thing?

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:08.020
The new core of the 
Digital World, made from all the

00:04:08.020 --> 00:04:10.810
Code Crowns that Bagramon collected.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.560
That's the Code Crown?

00:04:19.410 --> 00:04:22.730
At any rate, this Kingdom sure is creepy.

00:04:22.730 --> 00:04:24.080
Every place we've seen

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:26.730
looks like a ghost could 
jump out at any minute.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.180
Who's there?

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.600
Don't scare us like that!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:36.350
But someone was there...

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:38.320
Is someone there?

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.280
If you are, come out.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.530
We're not your enemies.

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:47.070
I-I'm Lopmon. Who are you?

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:48.740
I'm Taiki Kudou.

00:04:48.740 --> 00:04:49.640
This is...

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.770
Shoutmon!

00:04:51.070 --> 00:04:52.450
I'm Dondokomon.

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:54.620
I'm ChibiKamemon.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:55.910
I'm Cutemon!

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:58.230
I'm Nene, and this is...

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.460
Sparrowmon.

00:04:59.460 --> 00:05:02.460
So why are you hiding 
in a place like this?

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:04.060
She's after me...

00:05:04.060 --> 00:05:04.880
Who is?

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:10.220
She is! LadyDevimon of the Bagra Army!

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:15.340
Shoutmon!

00:05:15.340 --> 00:05:15.980
Right!

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:18.750
Soul Crusher!

00:05:23.200 --> 00:05:24.220
Yeah!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:35.280
She came back to life!

00:05:35.280 --> 00:05:37.410
She's immortal.

00:05:37.410 --> 00:05:38.220
Immortal?

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:46.090
Sparrowmon!

00:05:46.090 --> 00:05:47.090
Leave it to me!

00:05:47.090 --> 00:05:49.040
Random Laser!

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:52.230
Now's our chance! Run!

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:02.040
Looks like we lost them.

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:03.740
Hey...

00:06:04.320 --> 00:06:06.150
Was that LadyDevimon a

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:08.630
subordinate of this 
Kingdom's Death General?

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:09.950
Yes.

00:06:09.950 --> 00:06:13.350
She's a subordinate of the vampire 
who lives in that castle.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:14.550
Vampire?

00:06:14.550 --> 00:06:18.060
This Kingdom is ruled by a vampire.

00:06:18.060 --> 00:06:19.490
It's called Vampire Land.

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:23.260
Can you tell us more about this Kingdom?

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:24.230
Yes.

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:28.540
After the Bagra Army 
took over this Kingdom,

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.590
we built a village on 
the edge of the forest,

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.210
and have been living there in secret.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:37.650
We're small and weak,

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.580
so we've always survived 
by helping each other...

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:43.600
But the vampire cast a barrier of mist

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:47.800
that turned this place into 
a world of eternal night.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:50.960
What? So it's been nighttime ever since?

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.210
Yes. And when we

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:57.360
Digivolved from Chocomon to Lopmon,

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.970
the LadyDevimons captured 
every last Lopmon

00:07:01.370 --> 00:07:04.070
and took them to the vampire's castle.

00:07:04.840 --> 00:07:09.510
I was the only one of 
the remaining Chocomons

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:12.760
to Digivolve into Lopmon, just now.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.610
But I was afraid I'd be taken away...

00:07:15.610 --> 00:07:17.220
So I ran...

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:19.780
And then you met us.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:24.230
And what is the vampire doing 
to the Lopmon he captures?

00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:26.120
I don't know.

00:07:26.120 --> 00:07:29.260
Well, since he's a vampire,

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:33.900
he must be sinking his sharp 
fangs into their necks!

00:07:35.570 --> 00:07:38.010
Don't scare us like that!

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:38.770
Sorry.

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:41.710
Let's just hurry up and 
check on that village.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:45.820
What was that?

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.350
It came from the direction of my village!

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:52.720
Please stop!

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:55.750
We'll stop if you hand over Lopmon.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:59.360
But we really don't know where Lopmon is!

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.060
Is that so? Then...

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:08.100
We will continue to demolish this 
village until Lopmon appears!

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:09.900
Please stop!

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:13.600
Better hand him over quick, 
or this village is finished!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:14.520
Stop!

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:19.000
Destroying the Chocomon 
and Lopmon's village...

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.210
Don't be so cruel!

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.660
You kids again?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.050
Here they come.

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.880
Against a flying enemy...

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.490
We need Jet Sparrow.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:30.800
Yep! Here we go!

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:40.870
DigiXros!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.300
Use Plasma Blaster!

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:46.500
Right!

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.170
Take this! Plasma Blaster!

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:00.590
It's not working!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:03.090
Now it's my turn!

00:09:03.090 --> 00:09:05.360
Darkness Wave!

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:11.150
Jet Sparrow!

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.300
Now!

00:09:13.870 --> 00:09:15.550
Why, you...

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:16.800
MetalGreymon!

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:18.690
Giga Destroyer!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:22.340
Fire!

00:09:24.310 --> 00:09:24.970
Kiriha!

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.490
Fire! Keep firing!

00:09:41.090 --> 00:09:43.430
Even if they're immortal,

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:45.760
if we keep attacking so they don't 
have a chance to regenerate,

00:09:46.330 --> 00:09:48.000
their bodies will be destroyed...

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.170
and they can't come back to life!

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:53.970
I get it! We just need 
to destroy their bodies!

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:00.680
What are you doing?!

00:10:00.980 --> 00:10:04.060
You need to stay out of our way!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:04.970
What'd you say?!

00:10:04.970 --> 00:10:07.190
MetalGreymon is right.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:11.910
What do you guys think 
teamwork is, anyway?!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:13.960
You're always doing your own thing!

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.100
You mean when I took the other path?

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.160
If we all go the same direction,

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:21.310
not even knowing where it'll take us, 
it will only slow us down.

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:25.700
Besides, it looks like you didn't 
even know how to defeat a vampire.

00:10:26.280 --> 00:10:27.310
Don't bother.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:34.410
U-Um...

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.050
Thank you...

00:10:36.050 --> 00:10:37.680
...for saving us!

00:10:37.680 --> 00:10:40.600
Sure. Is anyone hurt?

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:41.910
We're okay!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.050
Taiki.

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:44.420
The Bagra Army's here.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:45.350
What?!

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.490
How many of them are there, anyway?!

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.770
For now, let's get away from here.

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:53.360
Taiki, what are we going to do now?

00:10:53.780 --> 00:10:57.060
I'm pretty sure the Bagra Army will 
attack us, no matter where we run.

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:59.000
If we continue to fight them each time,

00:10:59.000 --> 00:11:00.370
we'll only wear ourselves out.

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:02.070
So defeat him.

00:11:02.070 --> 00:11:07.180
We just have to defeat the Death 
General they call the vampire.

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:11.120
But the castle is protected 
at all times by a barrier.

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.650
A barrier?

00:11:14.230 --> 00:11:16.520
It looks like the barrier is originating

00:11:16.520 --> 00:11:18.860
from the very top of the castle.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:22.630
That's it!

00:11:23.010 --> 00:11:24.900
We'll disguise ourselves as LadyDevimon!

00:11:24.900 --> 00:11:25.690
What?

00:11:25.690 --> 00:11:27.800
Then we might be able to enter the castle

00:11:27.800 --> 00:11:29.700
and disable the barrier.

00:11:29.700 --> 00:11:32.530
When you've disabled it, give me a signal.

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:35.070
I'll be the one to destroy 
the Death General.

00:11:35.070 --> 00:11:36.290
What do you mean by that?!

00:11:36.290 --> 00:11:39.240
Are you saying we're all here 
just to make you stand out?!

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:40.070
Yes.

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:41.370
You little...

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.550
Okay, here's what we'll do.

00:11:42.550 --> 00:11:45.470
When we disable the barrier, 
we'll give you a signal,

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:47.300
then we'll attack the Death 
General simultaneously

00:11:47.300 --> 00:11:49.430
from inside and outside the castle.

00:11:49.430 --> 00:11:51.160
That'll be more efficient, 
don't you think?

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.260
Have it your way.

00:11:55.260 --> 00:11:56.880
What will the signal be?

00:11:56.880 --> 00:11:59.460
The castle's bell rings at midnight.

00:11:59.460 --> 00:12:02.830
Okay. The bell will be the signal.

00:12:12.930 --> 00:12:14.200
Chocomon...

00:12:14.950 --> 00:12:16.210
I'm sorry.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.160
I've caused everyone so much trouble

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.670
by running from the village.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:21.750
Lopmon!

00:12:21.750 --> 00:12:24.110
You don't have to worry about that.

00:12:24.110 --> 00:12:25.490
We're just glad you're okay.

00:12:25.490 --> 00:12:29.000
You guys aren't with 
Taiki and his friends?

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:32.330
They went to the castle 
to defeat the vampire.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:36.170
What?! Why would they 
go that far just for us?

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:37.970
Taiki said...

00:12:38.280 --> 00:12:42.370
<i>I can fight because I have 
friends I want to protect.</i>

00:12:43.430 --> 00:12:45.420
Because I have friends...

00:12:50.130 --> 00:12:52.650
Don't you think they'll notice?

00:12:52.650 --> 00:12:56.980
Don't worry. We'll just tell them you're 
an unusual sort of rare Lopmon.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:13:01.030
Are you sure? This vampire sounds scary...

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.930
Shh. The guards are watching us.

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:06.790
We have captured Lopmon.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.260
Open the gate!

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:09.670
What?

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.800
Looks like Lopmon, all right.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.860
Go disable the barrier.

00:13:14.860 --> 00:13:15.960
Okay.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.260
Follow me.

00:13:34.990 --> 00:13:38.830
I will inform the master. You wait here.

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:44.370
I found the switch that 
controls the barrier!

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:48.810
Okay. I'll stay here and keep the 
LadyDevimon's attention on me...

00:13:48.810 --> 00:13:52.000
And we'll destroy the device 
that controls the barrier.

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:54.830
Where are you going?!

00:13:55.570 --> 00:13:57.750
I told you to wait here!

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.970
Lopmon's trying to escape!

00:14:04.460 --> 00:14:05.060
What?!

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:07.320
Leave the rest to me!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.170
After that Lopmon!

00:14:10.130 --> 00:14:12.330
What are you doing?! After him, now!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:17.600
Monitamon, show me the way!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:19.000
With pleasure!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:24.580
This way!

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:32.520
So this is...

00:14:32.520 --> 00:14:34.750
The device that generates the barrier.

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.390
What's that?

00:14:37.390 --> 00:14:38.760
It's a coffin.

00:14:38.760 --> 00:14:39.930
A coffin?

00:14:39.930 --> 00:14:43.260
Vampires sleep in coffins, don't they?

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.730
Only during the day.

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:47.580
It's always night in this Kingdom,

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:49.550
so he can't be asleep now.

00:14:49.550 --> 00:14:53.240
Anyway, we have to stop the 
device before the bell rings.

00:15:02.260 --> 00:15:03.310
No!

00:15:05.230 --> 00:15:08.690
I thought you'd come, Taiki Kudou.

00:15:08.690 --> 00:15:09.350
Who are you?

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:14.510
Death General of the second 
Kingdom, Vampire Land:

00:15:14.510 --> 00:15:17.100
NeoVamdemon the Moon Light.

00:15:17.100 --> 00:15:19.320
You're the Death General?

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:21.320
Why are you kidnapping the Lopmon?!

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:25.440
Lopmon are known as servants to the gods.

00:15:25.440 --> 00:15:29.710
They are essential for my 
power to overcome death.

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:33.620
Power to overcome death? 
What does that mean?

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.880
Oh, no! The bell!

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.480
Taiki blew it!

00:15:43.050 --> 00:15:44.290
Here they come.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.170
Those Devimon also work for the vampire?!

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:51.200
Taiki Kudou, why do you fight?

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:54.130
Terrible things are happening 
to Lopmon and his friends!

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:55.470
I can't turn my back on them!

00:15:55.470 --> 00:15:57.920
You only just came to this Kingdom.

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:01.370
Why do you go to such 
great pains for them?

00:16:01.370 --> 00:16:04.160
When I see people suffering 
right in front of me,

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.480
my body acts before I have time to think.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.230
I may have just met them,

00:16:08.230 --> 00:16:11.480
but Lopmon and the 
Chocomon are our friends!

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:12.520
Taiki...

00:16:13.090 --> 00:16:18.100
You can talk big, but without this 
Xros Loader, you are a mere child.

00:16:18.100 --> 00:16:22.360
Let's see you fall to the depths 
of hell for your "friends!"

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.210
He's scary!

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.830
You!

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:28.200
Lopmon!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.870
I'll fight, too!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:31.100
For my friends!

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:33.870
Thanks, Lopmon.

00:16:33.870 --> 00:16:35.710
Insolent brat!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:36.810
Taiki!

00:16:36.810 --> 00:16:38.630
All right! Let's go!

00:16:53.390 --> 00:16:54.730
Shoutmon!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:56.130
Okay!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:57.500
Ballistamon!

00:16:58.760 --> 00:17:00.030
Dorulumon!

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:02.230
Starmons!

00:17:02.230 --> 00:17:03.790
Yes!

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.150
Sparrowmon!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.560
DigiXros!

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:10.310
DigiXros!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:26.220
Shoutmon X5!

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:32.260
X5! Hold him off for a bit!

00:17:32.560 --> 00:17:33.970
You got it!

00:17:35.900 --> 00:17:37.240
All right, now's our chance!

00:17:37.240 --> 00:17:38.670
Let's stop the barrier!

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:39.900
Death Claw!

00:17:43.240 --> 00:17:45.340
Blazing Ice!

00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:52.540
Way to go!

00:17:52.540 --> 00:17:53.690
Nice one, Lopmon!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:57.690
The barrier's gone! Let's go!

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:05.760
Gardiac Raid!

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.140
X5!

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.760
Use Meteor Impact!

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:17.600
All right!

00:18:19.210 --> 00:18:22.950
Meteor Impact!

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:24.680
What?!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.690
Nightmare Raid!

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.260
My data is being sucked out!

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.260
X5!

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.480
Plasma Cannon!

00:18:40.350 --> 00:18:41.400
Kiriha!

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.110
We'll defeat the Death General.

00:18:44.110 --> 00:18:46.600
You guys get rid of the Devimon!

00:18:46.600 --> 00:18:47.570
What?

00:18:49.670 --> 00:18:52.440
Why do we have to take orders from you?!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.550
So you're my opponent now, eh?

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:56.180
That's right.

00:18:56.180 --> 00:18:58.180
I will defeat you!

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:01.850
Greymon!

00:19:03.120 --> 00:19:04.490
MailBirdramon!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:07.610
DigiXros!

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:10.930
MetalGreymon!

00:19:12.610 --> 00:19:14.010
Use Trident Arm!

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:20.870
One after another...

00:19:22.070 --> 00:19:24.280
You guys don't know when to give up!

00:19:25.480 --> 00:19:26.840
Death Claw!

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.050
X5!

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:30.880
What?

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:32.420
There's still more of them coming?!

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.020
Reload, Beelzebumon!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:39.290
Death the Cannon!

00:19:44.860 --> 00:19:46.730
Thanks, Beelzebumon!

00:19:56.190 --> 00:19:59.060
X5! Use Meteor Buster Attack!

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:02.420
Meter Buster Attack!

00:20:02.420 --> 00:20:04.080
Wow, cool!

00:20:06.560 --> 00:20:07.390
What?

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.650
There are still so many of them?!

00:20:09.650 --> 00:20:11.520
I'll destroy you as 
many times as it takes!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:13.990
Don't make me laugh.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:17.660
Darkness Loader, DigiXros!

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:33.050
What's with this guy?

00:20:33.050 --> 00:20:34.810
He forced them to DigiXros?!

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:38.770
MetalGreymon! Use Trident Arm!

00:20:40.390 --> 00:20:42.750
Giga Gardiac Raid!

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.160
MetalGreymon!

00:20:46.860 --> 00:20:48.390
Reload, Decker—

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:49.710
I can't let you do that.

00:20:52.400 --> 00:20:53.570
Now...

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:55.200
It's our turn!

00:20:55.200 --> 00:20:56.350
Out of the way!

00:20:57.770 --> 00:20:59.170
What are you doing?!

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:02.070
I told you that we would 
defeat the Death General!

00:21:02.070 --> 00:21:05.480
Kiriha! We need to work together now!

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:07.790
This is my battle!

00:21:07.790 --> 00:21:10.560
MetalGreymon! Giga Destroyer!

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:13.770
Fire! Fire! Keep firing!

00:21:15.020 --> 00:21:16.450
He's the same!

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.390
Just destroy his body before 
he can regenerate and...

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:21.530
And what?

00:21:23.060 --> 00:21:27.130
That won't work on me.

00:21:28.430 --> 00:21:29.700
I'm not finished!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:31.500
Go, MetalGreymon!

00:21:33.240 --> 00:21:36.510
Darkness Loader, DigiXros!

00:21:36.510 --> 00:21:37.610
What?!

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:54.660
MetalGreymon...

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:56.570
He's been absorbed...

00:22:07.150 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:22:09.690 --> 00:22:13.200
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:22:10.650 --> 00:22:13.200
Digimon Data Collection!

00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:22:13.770 --> 00:22:17.150
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:22:14.160 --> 00:22:15.160
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.160
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:22:16.160 --> 00:22:17.150
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:22:19.880 --> 00:22:33.560
<b>[Type]</b>

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:26.990
<b>Puppet Type</b>

00:22:23.120 --> 00:22:33.560
<b>[Attack]</b>

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Animal Nails</b>

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:39.570
<b>Puppet</b>

00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:29.260
A Digimon that looks just 
like a stuffed animal.

00:22:29.260 --> 00:22:32.620
His attack, Animal Nails, 
uses the claws concealed on

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:33.740
the underside of his paws.

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:35.580
The clever panda conceals its claws!

00:22:35.580 --> 00:22:39.570
I want to go see the pandas at the zoo!

00:22:40.950 --> 00:22:42.540
If we can find NeoVamdemon's weakness,

00:22:42.540 --> 00:22:45.210
a White Lopmon, we can defeat him!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:46.210
But we don't have much time!

00:22:46.640 --> 00:22:48.280
Just wait, MetalGreymon!

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:50.420
I swear I'll save you!

00:22:50.780 --> 00:22:52.020
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:53.860
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>Don't Die, Greymon!</b>

00:22:52.020 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Birth of Shoutmon DX</b>
